Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes. This repository uses
`.heisenberg/policy.json` and `.heisenberg/skills.json` as the machine-readable
workflow contract. Load only skills selected by the active task manifest and
record required artifacts under `.heisenberg/artifacts/<task-id>/`.

Do not claim a task is complete without a current receipt and validation
evidence. Treat unavailable MCP tools as unavailable; never fabricate graph
analysis or tool output.
